== (2) one-step geometric Gauss sums G_j(t) = c_j sum_r 2^-r e(t 2^-r/3^j) over units t ==
   j= 1: sup_t |G_j| = 0.57735 at t = 1 (t/3^j = 0.3333; 2-adic reading agrees: True); mean |G_j| = 0.5774; share of units with |G_j| > 0.9: 0.0000
