== (4) carry-polynomial reciprocity and reversed cycles ==
   C_rev(w)(3,2) = 3^(d-1) 2^A C'_w(1/3, 1/2) (inclusive-prefix carry) on 200 random words: True
   example w = (1,2): C_w = 5, C'_w = 14, C_rev = 7 = 3 * 8 * C'_w(1/3, 1/2) = 7
   -1: word [1], C_w = 1, y_0 = C_w/(2^A - 3^k) = -1; reversed word [1], C_rev = 1, y_0' = -1 (integer; rotation of the original: True)
   {-5,-7}: word [1, 2], C_w = 5, y_0 = C_w/(2^A - 3^k) = -5; reversed word [2, 1], C_rev = 7, y_0' = -7 (integer; rotation of the original: True)
   7-cycle of -17: word [1, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 4], C_w = 2363, y_0 = C_w/(2^A - 3^k) = -17; reversed word [4, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1], C_rev = 13801, y_0' = -13801/139 (rational, not integer; rotation of the original: False)
